  "description": "Dan-Bi Lee’s fortune app warns her to brace for a tidal wave. She just doesn’t expect it to show up in a tailored suit. Hae-Il Han, her high school first love, is back after ten years. Now he’s a Silicon Valley success, heir to the company she works for, and, worst of all, her new boss. Dan-Bi wants to keep her head down, her job intact, and the past where it belongs. Hae-Il didn’t come back to play it safe. He came back for her.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
